WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:10.900
Yugi Muto assembled the Millennium Puzzle and became the guardian of the Shadow Games.

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:17.260
Pegasus has a Millennium Item of his own - the Millennium Eye.

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:21.800
Yugi accepts Pegasus's challenge and goes to Duelist Kingdom.

00:00:23.650 --> 00:00:27.800
Pegasus stole his grandfather Sugoroku's soul, and Yugi intends to rescue him.

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:33.850
He battles alongside his trusted friends and with his other self.

00:00:39.230 --> 00:00:44.300
I can't finish reading the magazine pages

00:00:46.220 --> 00:00:51.210
I get the feeling that I must read it

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:57.960
Game cartridges are stacked in the corner of the room

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:04.660
Is there no meaning if I don't play them?

00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:09.760
You're on the other side of the table

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:13.130
I'm talking to you, but...

00:01:13.730 --> 00:01:20.060
You don't change your facial expression at all

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:26.310
Even though I'm this close to you

00:01:26.810 --> 00:01:33.580
These feelings don't reach you, don't reach you

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:40.320
What is truly precious?

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:51.320
Yugi!

00:01:52.200 --> 00:01:55.030
Use your card to finish me!

00:01:55.280 --> 00:01:56.500
Here I go, Kaiba!

00:01:56.960 --> 00:01:58.260
Celtic Guardian!

00:02:00.340 --> 00:02:02.070
Yugi!  No!

00:02:04.360 --> 00:02:07.180
Yugi, return to your old self!

00:02:25.020 --> 00:02:27.260
Yugi, you...

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:30.420
I'm scared.

00:02:30.420 --> 00:02:33.230
I'm scared of these games and my other self!

00:02:39.940 --> 00:02:45.940
Duel of Tears!
Shining Friendship

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:01.160
Yugi.

00:03:05.440 --> 00:03:08.230
Use your card to finish me!

00:03:08.520 --> 00:03:09.700
Here I go, Kaiba!

00:03:10.240 --> 00:03:11.500
Celtic Guardian!

00:03:13.800 --> 00:03:15.240
Stop, Yugi!

00:03:20.920 --> 00:03:22.400
I had no choice.

00:03:22.780 --> 00:03:27.050
If I continued the duel, Kaiba would've died.

00:03:29.760 --> 00:03:36.860
But it doesn't change the fact that I interfered in my other self's duel.

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:43.520
I can't do anything without my other self.

00:03:43.760 --> 00:03:45.180
But still...

00:03:46.300 --> 00:03:47.720
It's my fault.

00:03:47.720 --> 00:03:51.220
If only I didn't stop Yugi...

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:58.720
Yugi, take my Star Chips.

00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:01.220
Jonouchi...

00:04:01.640 --> 00:04:05.380
I was only able to enter because you gave me your Star Chip.

00:04:05.380 --> 00:04:07.230
These belong to you, Yugi.

00:04:08.120 --> 00:04:09.460
Jonouchi...

00:04:10.120 --> 00:04:12.400
There's still time left.

00:04:12.400 --> 00:04:14.970
I'll duel with all my might and collect more.

00:04:15.180 --> 00:04:17.240
Take them, Yugi.

00:04:21.600 --> 00:04:24.680
Yugi, say something!

00:04:24.680 --> 00:04:25.540
Jonouchi!

00:04:25.540 --> 00:04:27.810
Don't you care what happens to your grandpa?

00:04:28.520 --> 00:04:30.670
I have to do something!  Or else...

00:04:30.670 --> 00:04:32.640
What are you doing here?

00:04:34.020 --> 00:04:34.920
Mai!

00:04:37.860 --> 00:04:41.580
Jonouchi, you managed to collect ten Star Chips?

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:45.860
Yeah, but they're about to be reduced by half.

00:04:47.500 --> 00:04:49.900
No way!  Did Yugi...

00:04:56.060 --> 00:04:58.800
Pegasus, here I come!

00:05:02.750 --> 00:05:04.280
Beautiful.

00:05:05.480 --> 00:05:09.790
I can see his fires of rage.

00:05:10.420 --> 00:05:14.170
What a beautiful view.

00:05:15.140 --> 00:05:20.300
I love being the recipient of immense hatred.

00:05:28.520 --> 00:05:29.910
Yugi lost?

00:05:32.220 --> 00:05:33.410
You must be joking!

00:05:33.780 --> 00:05:36.760
You're finished before entering the castle?

00:05:36.760 --> 00:05:38.920
I won't allow it!

00:05:43.660 --> 00:05:44.940
Mai.

00:05:46.250 --> 00:05:48.560
But if you give them up, you can't enter.

00:05:49.620 --> 00:05:51.830
Who do you think I am?

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:56.700
You have sixteen Star Chips.

00:05:56.700 --> 00:05:58.680
Impressive as always, Mai Kujaku.

00:05:58.680 --> 00:05:59.810
Good work.

00:06:00.230 --> 00:06:01.940
What did you expect?

00:06:01.940 --> 00:06:03.810
I'm paying back my debt.

00:06:04.200 --> 00:06:06.980
But in return, you have to duel me inside the castle.

00:06:08.340 --> 00:06:09.820
You're lucky, Yugi.

00:06:09.820 --> 00:06:11.240
Take them.

00:06:11.240 --> 00:06:12.680
You can now enter the castle.

00:06:18.360 --> 00:06:19.740
I misjudged you!

00:06:19.740 --> 00:06:24.700
If losing one duel gets you this down, you're nothing special!

00:06:25.080 --> 00:06:27.540
You're wrong.  Yugi lost because I-

00:06:27.540 --> 00:06:32.920
Fine.  If you don't feel like taking them for free, let's duel right now.

00:06:36.170 --> 00:06:38.480
You can't complain about that.  C'mon!

00:06:41.720 --> 00:06:42.970
Wait!

00:06:43.740 --> 00:06:46.680
Mai, I'll duel instead!

00:06:48.220 --> 00:06:51.720
If I win, I get those Star Chips.

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:54.660
There's no way you can win!

00:06:54.660 --> 00:06:58.830
I have the responsibility of taking Yugi to the castle!

00:06:59.120 --> 00:07:01.430
Mai, duel me!

00:07:02.370 --> 00:07:06.670
I'm amazed that you think that you can actually defeat me.

00:07:09.220 --> 00:07:12.680
I promise to win because I have to!

00:07:14.320 --> 00:07:19.200
As long as the Star Chips end up in Yugi's hands, I don't really care.

00:07:20.420 --> 00:07:25.060
Fine, I accept.  But under one condition.

00:07:25.420 --> 00:07:26.580
Condition?

00:07:26.580 --> 00:07:32.300
If you lose, you have to stop spouting that nonsense about friends and friendship.

00:07:33.120 --> 00:07:34.070
Got it?

00:07:36.700 --> 00:07:37.920
It feels like...

00:07:37.920 --> 00:07:39.810
...the situation is getting weird.

00:07:49.720 --> 00:07:51.320
Start the duel!

00:07:57.720 --> 00:07:58.990
I'll go first.

00:08:01.090 --> 00:08:03.260
Tensions are high.

00:08:03.260 --> 00:08:07.270
She's more intense than usual.

00:08:07.770 --> 00:08:09.000
It's my turn!

00:08:09.320 --> 00:08:11.180
I play Petit Angel in attack position.

00:08:15.800 --> 00:08:17.380
It looks weak.

00:08:17.520 --> 00:08:20.010
Why are you bringing out a cute monster?

00:08:22.380 --> 00:08:25.740
My turn!  I play Harpie Lady in attack position!

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:34.040
And I set this card on the field.

00:08:34.520 --> 00:08:35.760
Huh?

00:08:35.760 --> 00:08:36.560
Let's battle!

00:08:51.070 --> 00:08:56.500
If you're seriously trying to defeat me, try using a more formidable attack!

00:08:57.350 --> 00:08:58.520
My turn!

00:08:59.050 --> 00:09:02.980
I play Fairy's Gift in attack position.

00:09:05.220 --> 00:09:07.620
That's why I never play with amateurs.

00:09:07.860 --> 00:09:10.530
Using higher attack points isn't everything.

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:15.030
What's this?

00:09:15.640 --> 00:09:23.100
Stay calm.  When the trap card Waboku activates, it reduces battle damage to 0 for that turn.

00:09:23.800 --> 00:09:26.020
This may come in handy later.

00:09:26.760 --> 00:09:27.610
And next...

00:09:28.640 --> 00:09:30.650
I set one card.

00:09:32.900 --> 00:09:36.640
Doesn't it seem like she's just copying her opponent?

00:09:36.640 --> 00:09:38.760
I hope she knows a way to win.

00:09:40.540 --> 00:09:43.140
Let's battle!  Fairy Dust!

00:09:48.220 --> 00:09:50.370
My attack points are higher than hers.

00:10:02.460 --> 00:10:03.680
But why?

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:05.680
Not good enough.

00:10:08.520 --> 00:10:11.040
I activate the spell card Rose Whip!

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:14.060
It raises Harpie Lady's attack points by 300.

00:10:41.500 --> 00:10:44.120
Go, Harpie Lady!  Red Hell Ripper!

00:10:57.340 --> 00:11:00.340
You're going to defeat me?  Don't make me laugh!

00:11:01.600 --> 00:11:02.800
Mai is impressive.

00:11:03.500 --> 00:11:07.780
She set Rose Whip to entice her opponent to attack.

00:11:07.780 --> 00:11:15.600
Anzu thought she had more attack points and attacked, but Mai used her set card to raise her own attack points.

00:11:16.770 --> 00:11:20.560
You said that it was your fault that Yugi lost.

00:11:22.280 --> 00:11:25.150
I hate that more than anything!

00:11:25.150 --> 00:11:27.470
Stop being conceited!

00:11:27.800 --> 00:11:30.070
What?  I'm not conceited!

00:11:30.920 --> 00:11:34.400
All duelists are alone when they battle.

00:11:34.400 --> 00:11:39.150
They can't get help from anyone else, and they can only trust themselves.

00:11:39.600 --> 00:11:43.050
Yugi lost because he wasn't good enough!

00:11:43.250 --> 00:11:44.770
You're wrong!

00:11:44.770 --> 00:11:48.550
If you can win by having your friends cheer for you, dueling would be easy!

00:11:48.850 --> 00:11:54.790
If you truly believe that you helped Yugi win, that means you're conceited!

00:12:01.300 --> 00:12:02.400
I play this next.

00:12:02.920 --> 00:12:05.000
I set one card and end my turn!

00:12:05.420 --> 00:12:08.510
Another set card.  What can it be?

00:12:12.380 --> 00:12:14.060
Shining Friendship.

00:12:14.480 --> 00:12:15.560
Friendship...

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:18.320
This is the symbol of our friendship.

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:22.420
That's right.  The bond between us is more important than anything.

00:12:22.420 --> 00:12:23.980
That's friendship.

00:12:24.380 --> 00:12:27.560
I must protect this card!

00:12:30.100 --> 00:12:31.240
Do your best, Anzu!

00:12:31.240 --> 00:12:32.240
Don't lose!

00:12:33.800 --> 00:12:34.770
Yugi...

00:12:40.020 --> 00:12:41.410
I've made my decision.

00:12:42.000 --> 00:12:46.220
I'll bet our entire friendship on this card!

00:12:46.810 --> 00:12:49.100
I play Shining Friendship in attack position!

00:12:50.720 --> 00:12:54.360
What can you do with that one monster?

00:12:54.360 --> 00:12:57.380
Battle, Harpie Lady!  Red Hell Ripper!

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:02.030
I activate my trap card!

00:13:02.350 --> 00:13:03.460
Waboku!

00:13:17.900 --> 00:13:20.000
Anzu is playing well!

00:13:20.000 --> 00:13:20.750
Yeah.

00:13:21.060 --> 00:13:25.020
Now that you mention it, Anzu used to beat you all the time.

00:13:25.020 --> 00:13:26.060
Leave me alone!

00:13:26.920 --> 00:13:31.620
Mai, I promise to protect Shining Friendship!

00:13:32.460 --> 00:13:36.130
I'm entrusting our friendship to this card!

00:13:36.600 --> 00:13:42.030
No matter what you say, I believe in my friends.  I believe in Yugi!

00:13:46.320 --> 00:13:49.980
That's right.  We were always together.

00:13:50.370 --> 00:13:53.480
And we finally made it this far.

00:13:53.870 --> 00:13:56.980
That's why we can't leave anyone behind!

00:13:57.300 --> 00:13:58.980
No matter what!

00:14:02.270 --> 00:14:06.600
Yugi, did you hear what Anzu said?  She means it!

00:14:06.770 --> 00:14:10.720
She's betting everything on this duel so that she can get you into the castle!

00:14:10.900 --> 00:14:15.260
And you're still thinking of giving up and quitting?

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:21.010
Save your pretty speeches after you've won the duel.

00:14:21.620 --> 00:14:24.380
I promise that I won't lose!

00:14:26.100 --> 00:14:27.380
Magician of Faith!

00:14:27.870 --> 00:14:29.220
In defense position!

00:14:29.620 --> 00:14:36.880
Then I use the spell card Silver Bow and Arrow to raise Shining Friendship's attack and defense points by 300!

00:14:38.160 --> 00:14:39.430
Not good enough.

00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:43.020
I play the spell card Cyber Shield!

00:14:43.850 --> 00:14:46.270
Harpie Lady will wear it.

00:14:53.650 --> 00:14:56.220
She gains 500 attack points!

00:14:56.510 --> 00:14:59.750
Then I activate De-Spell!

00:15:06.650 --> 00:15:07.740
This is bad.

00:15:07.740 --> 00:15:10.060
She's on a totally different level.

00:15:11.880 --> 00:15:16.450
I don't know what you have set, but I'll get rid of it first.

00:15:22.740 --> 00:15:24.770
Magician of Faith is destroyed!

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:27.180
Don't just stand there!

00:15:27.180 --> 00:15:32.140
Since Magician of Faith was flipped face-up, you can bring one spell card back from your graveyard!

00:15:35.310 --> 00:15:39.120
The way you're playing, you can't defeat me in a million years.

00:15:39.680 --> 00:15:46.230
Like I said, you can't survive in this world with your friendship nonsense.

00:15:47.160 --> 00:15:48.590
That's not true!

00:15:49.710 --> 00:15:53.100
Win or lose.  The result is all that matters in competition.

00:15:53.400 --> 00:16:00.910
To survive in this harsh world, your friends may help you overcome the struggles.

00:16:01.740 --> 00:16:05.310
But in the end, you can only count on yourself!

00:16:05.980 --> 00:16:11.620
When you're on the verge of defeat in a duel, what do you need to survive?

00:16:11.920 --> 00:16:15.890
What you need is the inner strength to make your own decisions!

00:16:17.280 --> 00:16:19.920
Strength to make my own decisions...

00:16:20.990 --> 00:16:27.240
If a duelist doesn't have the courage, he'll lose the match and betray the hopes of his friends!

00:16:29.760 --> 00:16:33.940
I still want to protect my friends!  I want to protect Yugi!

00:16:33.940 --> 00:16:42.980
Even if Yugi has to make his own decision in the end, I want to support him until that time.

00:16:43.680 --> 00:16:48.000
That's why I want Yugi to get into the castle!

00:16:54.280 --> 00:16:55.230
Anzu...

00:16:55.230 --> 00:17:02.120
No matter what happens from here on out, I'll support Yugi to the end!

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:06.780
That's the meaning of friendship!

00:17:09.160 --> 00:17:12.510
I won't lose.  I'll protect our friendship!

00:17:12.720 --> 00:17:15.010
If you think you can, go ahead and try.

00:17:17.160 --> 00:17:19.520
The spell card Elf's Light.

00:17:20.160 --> 00:17:24.120
Light Attribute monsters gain 400 attack points.

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:26.280
This is De-Spell.

00:17:26.880 --> 00:17:29.660
Mai played this card last turn.

00:17:29.920 --> 00:17:35.600
Wait!  Silver Bow and Arrow raises Shining Friendship's attack points to 1600.

00:17:35.600 --> 00:17:40.110
If I also use Elf's Light's effect, it will have 2000 attack points.

00:17:40.520 --> 00:17:44.110
If I then use De-Spell to remove Cyber Shield...

00:17:47.180 --> 00:17:48.460
My turn!

00:17:48.460 --> 00:17:53.620
I play the spell card Silver Bow and Arrow to raise Shining Friendship's attack points by 300.

00:17:55.020 --> 00:17:57.970
Next, I activate the spell card Elf's Light!

00:18:01.940 --> 00:18:05.260
Shining Friendship gains 400 attack points!

00:18:06.920 --> 00:18:09.340
It seems this match is over.  Let's battle!

00:18:11.280 --> 00:18:12.040
There's more!

00:18:13.110 --> 00:18:16.610
I use De-Spell to destroy Cyber Shield!

00:18:25.420 --> 00:18:26.450
Let's battle!

00:18:26.450 --> 00:18:29.360
Shining Friendship!  Silver Lightning Arrow!

00:18:39.240 --> 00:18:41.030
Harpie Lady is destroyed!

00:18:41.280 --> 00:18:42.320
You did it!

00:18:42.320 --> 00:18:45.440
I think she's still stronger than you.

00:18:45.640 --> 00:18:46.720
She did it.

00:18:56.840 --> 00:18:58.940
Is that a trap card?

00:19:00.640 --> 00:19:03.760
I lose.  It's my time to leave.

00:19:04.520 --> 00:19:06.260
But the duel isn't over.

00:19:06.480 --> 00:19:10.640
Once I've lost my Harpie, my duel is over.

00:19:10.640 --> 00:19:13.920
My pride won't allow me to duel anymore.

00:19:14.680 --> 00:19:16.120
I did it!

00:19:17.820 --> 00:19:19.240
You're incredible, Anzu!

00:19:19.240 --> 00:19:20.640
You did it!

00:19:23.320 --> 00:19:24.660
Mai...

00:19:26.220 --> 00:19:29.980
Mai, was your set card Harpie's Feather Duster-

00:19:29.980 --> 00:19:34.520
What a joke!  It's your fault that I lost to her!

00:19:36.560 --> 00:19:39.560
We'll settle this inside the castle.

00:19:40.130 --> 00:19:41.380
Mai.

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:43.130
Yugi.

00:19:44.940 --> 00:19:48.220
Please use these to save your grandpa.

00:19:48.480 --> 00:19:49.740
Anzu...

00:19:50.500 --> 00:19:52.470
Okay!  I'll try!

00:19:52.680 --> 00:19:53.940
Yugi!

00:19:54.680 --> 00:19:59.080
I'll battle using my own ideas and make my own decisions.

00:19:59.700 --> 00:20:04.820
That's what it means to be a duelist.  Right, my other self?

00:20:07.060 --> 00:20:09.380
I'll cheer you on forever!

00:20:09.380 --> 00:20:10.880
Yeah!  Thanks!

00:20:11.380 --> 00:20:12.380
All right!

00:20:12.380 --> 00:20:14.460
Our friendship is forever!

00:20:14.460 --> 00:20:16.760
How long are you gonna keep blabbing?

00:20:16.760 --> 00:20:19.200
If you don't hurry, you'll run out of time!

00:20:19.800 --> 00:20:21.220
Okay, let's go!

00:20:21.220 --> 00:20:22.130
Yeah!

00:20:23.380 --> 00:20:24.640
Here we come!

00:20:36.840 --> 00:20:40.440
We finally enter Pegasus's castle for the final tournament.

00:20:40.440 --> 00:20:44.720
But before that, there's a special match between Kaiba and Pegasus.

00:20:44.720 --> 00:20:48.590
Kaiba challenges Pegasus to save his brother Mokuba.

00:20:48.590 --> 00:20:54.670
But he can't use his trusted Duel Disk against Pegasus, who can read minds.

00:20:54.670 --> 00:20:58.800
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Save Mokuba!
Kaiba vs Pegasus

00:20:58.800 --> 00:21:00.440
Duel, standby!

00:21:05.860 --> 00:21:14.260
The flask glistens

00:21:15.300 --> 00:21:22.110
Wait for me in the science classroom

00:21:22.600 --> 00:21:31.080
If we put our cold hands together

00:21:31.780 --> 00:21:38.860
And rub them together, they become warm

00:21:40.560 --> 00:21:44.690
Shower of happiness

00:21:44.980 --> 00:21:48.800
I will shower you with it

00:21:49.130 --> 00:21:57.070
I will support you even when you feel lonely

00:21:57.270 --> 00:22:01.310
Shower of happiness

00:22:01.580 --> 00:22:05.440
You are not alone

00:22:05.820 --> 00:22:12.160
You're protected by a giant ring of friendship
